5f1-abcd18457554\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Myconid_Adult_GreenSpores</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Myconid_Adult_GreenSpores+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Myconid_Adult_GreenSpores+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"treasure\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\"><abbr title=\"Treasure table\">Trs.</abbr></div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>UND_Myconid_GenericCorpse</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_Myconid_GenericCorpse+type:treasure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_Myconid_GenericCorpse+type:treasure\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Dead Myconid Sprout</b> is a myconid character in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The Dead Myconid Sprout's corpse can be found dead in the <a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;105&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-110</span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Speak_with_Dead\">Speak with Dead</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>Who were you?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...a sprout...*))</dd></dl></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>How did you die?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...bang! grey dwarves... hurt hurt <b>hurt</b>...*))</dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>These grey dwarves - what did they want here?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...gnome. death. gnome-death...*))</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>Where do you keep your riches?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...magic. behind the... the door*))</dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>How do I get past the door to your treasure?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...old ones enter. Sovereign enters. no one else...*))</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>What was your role in the circle?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...to grow. to know. to be one with the Circle...*))</dd></dl></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>What was life in the circle like?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Dead Myconid Sprout</dt><dd>((*...floating, knowing, seeing, hearing. all together, never apart...*))</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3w